 "changes": [
  "ReviewAcceptance alone commits review facts and integration intents; authority reads, preparation, messages, advancement and status are separate concrete owners.",
  "Integration uses an already-constructed read-only ReviewAuthorityReader; the public Review workflow callback is absent.",
  "TurnAdmission owns pure Human/Delivery arbitration; PrincipalSession retains actual process, RPC/UI and credential lifetimes.",
  "BrokerListeners owns readiness and in-flight close observations; Broker retains final admission/drain/Store/lease authority.",
  "Pi autocomplete uses public wrappers and constructors with no prototype/private fdPath writes. Remaining search-init resolution seam checks exact Pi/Pi TUI 1.0.1 and exports.",
  "Factories capture an active cwd string, never a stale extension context; repeated wrappers are idempotent. Personal saved confirmation uses the current post-reload UI.",
  "Store capabilities reuse decoder-issued provenance without a concrete Store type backreference. Diagnostics, native adapters and Society conversation boundaries use narrow ports.",
  "evidence:refresh derives graph, source inventory, review ledger and structural input binding; authored reviews/norms and historical runtime PASS are not regenerated.",
  "Additional defects: acceptance mutated readonly frozen recipient arrays; build launch error with status zero could report stale outputs as successful; SystemdSessionLauncher loaded GuestHost only for listening."
 ],
